WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.900
How many of us could lose money
for five years and still say:

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:04.980
I'm going to make it?

3
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.940
I'd ask a harder question.

4
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.180
Where is the line where you say:

5
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.030
I made a wrong call?

6
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.390
And where is the line where you say:

7
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.750
no, my conviction is right?

8
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.500
I call the danger getting
drunk on your own idea.

9
00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.370
You are inspired,

10
00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.970
and you stop watching the basics.

11
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.530
Ego without logic brings you down.

12
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.550
In my twenties I ignored the margins.

13
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.200
Sales and volume looked great.

14
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.290
The margins weren't there.

15
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.320
My fix: ask people who know the field.

16
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.160
Not an uncle in a different business.

17
00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.130
People who've done it.

18
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.360
Write one project where
you're losing money or time.

19
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.980
Then write why you think it will work.

